```sql
CREATE TABLE bookings(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, seats INTEGER CHECK(seats BETWEEN 1 AND 4));
INSERT INTO bookings VALUES(1,3);
SELECT id,seats
FROM bookings
ORDER BY id;
```
The stored seats value is 3, inside the inclusive range.

```sql
CREATE TABLE bookings(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, seats INTEGER CHECK(seats BETWEEN 1 AND 4));
INSERT INTO bookings VALUES(1,NULL);
SELECT id,seats
FROM bookings
ORDER BY id;
```
The stored seats value is NULL. The CHECK result is NULL, which SQLite accepts; this does not mean NULL is between the numbers.

